# Charmbracelet VHS Declarative Hero Proof — Agentic SDLC Framework
# Generate docs/demo.gif with: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 940
Set Height 440
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "npx github:fmatar/agentic-sdlc-framework install --agents gemini,claude,cursor --with-archlens --with-hooks --yes"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "node .agent/scripts/sdlc-engine.mjs doctor"
Enter
Sleep 4s
